<p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>

<p>You have been invited to join <strong><%= orgName %></strong> on PropAI.</p>

<% if (tempPassword) { %>
  <p>An account has been created for you. Your temporary password is: <strong><%= tempPassword %></strong></p>
  <p>Please log in and change your password during your first session.</p>
<% } else { %>
  <p>Your existing account has been linked to the organization. You can now access organizational tools.</p>
<% } %>

<p>
  <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #3525CD; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold;">
    Log in to PropAI
  </a>
</p>

<p>If you have any questions, please contact your organization administrator.</p>
